msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was merely offering you a greeting, milady.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or is even that a new "
"experience to you?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Your innocence is truly precious."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vi stavo solo porgendo il mio saluto, milady.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫O forse anche questa è una "
"nuova esperienza per voi?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫La vostra purezza è davvero adorabile."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3001C969_0AB7_4257_9439_EF3EC6F0269A
