msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wha— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Michelle?!⟪k:5⟫Hey, come back! Michelle!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Che— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Michelle?!⟪k:5⟫Ehi, torna qui! Michelle!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7A7BED4D_F647_41CF_91C8_1B78FE6C7AE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c4ffe0596cfa17215c1692d7a96acf7d2c4b014634d3c2184a4e109664c9fb8
#. default-sha256: 2c9734cbe3fade56dbe632825470c98c2b1687bc7fa9b55b99cb9190ff6baca9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7A7BED4D_F647_41CF_91C8_1B78FE6C7AE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had drawn a fair bit of attention, and other people tried to stop me too, ⟪k:1⟫but I "
"brushed them all off, marching my way out of the great hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avevo attirato un bel po’ di attenzioni, e anche altre persone avevano provato a fermarmi, "
"⟪k:1⟫ma le scansai tutte via, facendomi strada lontano dal salone."

#: scenario7:scenario7_417253AF_B5D0_4F75_BDE1_B676770EE993
