msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4AE547C9_A935_419E_8B47_E16038802C7D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll be taking that!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Questo lo prendo io!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_423131A6_FDB2_4843_A2D2_366A47EDE7AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e6b36241f675ef3f67069bc42e5f1a5b714b63554f913b2feddda8052ddb3b93
#. default-sha256: b7ec9fe49961cad8efd78a19adb53fe0fad4ecffe92d82bd54f916f2c9c5679e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_423131A6_FDB2_4843_A2D2_366A47EDE7AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With it, I washed my hand by the window facing the courtyard.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But no matter how "
"much water I poured over it, I couldn’t erase⟪k:3⟫the sickening sensation of his mouth on my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La usai per lavarmi la mano vicino alla finestra che si affacciava al cortile.⟪k:1⟫ Ma per "
"quanta acqua ci versassi, non riuscivo a rimuovere la disgustosa sensazione della sua bocca sulla "
"mia mano."

#: scenario7:scenario7_731EAA52_F6C7_4A77_9829_D33EBA2154C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 432c3d70eb9a85fd6f63c37904c1a54afca70576b180368949dfe76ae57d5315
#. default-sha256: ee80044ac9584b02fdefcde1badee5d3d9157ff45714f9e1ecdccc66a1c28807
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_731EAA52_F6C7_4A77_9829_D33EBA2154C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Think before you act, Georges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What were you doing inviting people like that into "
"our home?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rifletti prima di agire, Georges.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cos’avevi intenzione di fare invitando gente come "
"quella a casa nostra?!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0794717_90B7_4842_A4B5_5821DE9E76DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 239a4d68bc6e3d897017fa25793041d5278e5c56ef740e1da376bd62fb58ada1
#. default-sha256: 82deae510b977b2eac4a213117b2d6baf3116159ec180e8772c4af0566d62e22
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0794717_90B7_4842_A4B5_5821DE9E76DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was not acceptable behavior for an aristocrat.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He was a guest—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫he "
"should have been ashamed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non era un comportamento accettabile per un aristocratico.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Era un ospite—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"si sarebbe dovuto vergognare."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5DD944F0_3960_4D27_8CF5_6B45E44EE186
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7e80b4d2c64e8239caf2e053b96dc0d9d9c246e1d65257ffce0711914aefe0e
