msgstr "⟪k:0⟫No, non era quello il motivo. ⟪k:1⟫Era—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7E51F38D_512F_4DB6_8919_6B887DF4BFFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61b0686d1a838f789b88b15489079c68c14fb8dd3639bfb3c5a5b287f6c6b2ea
