msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7E51F38D_512F_4DB6_8919_6B887DF4BFFA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t very nice of ya, runnin’ off like that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non è stato carino da parte tua, correre via in quel modo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6196453A_A457_4F87_8764_022166054E43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29f537ef7b12ecb115b4fe03e3d42e02fb98be98a7d3046e7d87e80670cc920a
#. default-sha256: 810b311445e99a122103cedabd9c0ded34e70d20fc7dec580912fad607067eb8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6196453A_A457_4F87_8764_022166054E43"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt a sickening warmth almost directly against my back. ⟪k:1⟫The man from the great hall "
"grabbed me by the wrists, spun me around, and pressed me against the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sentii uno sgradevole calore contro la mia schiena. ⟪k:1⟫L’uomo del salone mi afferrò per un "
"polso, mi girò, e mi spinse contro il muro."

#: scenario7:scenario7_505D9FA8_9319_446A_9840_6285F0E571F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d98830d8db8337420a4d0846a4f52f9b2848cb7083864b62c74e5f83cf4f72c6
#. default-sha256: 44a745181e054d2897bc041fec4bc2fc97658592e4c2f5834ae249c79d45383c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_505D9FA8_9319_446A_9840_6285F0E571F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The bitter scent of wine wafted from above."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dall’alto si diffondeva un forte aroma di vino."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D140738E_BA9B_4F3D_8411_8E98B35C97B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3255e8f89c7ef4d6e8b65b47a5dbaaa1f83fde7c377608d810a8b76bd2bd4849
#. default-sha256: 2ed9bec81e13dfb44da7cd9d969118ff6efc4252dd3a3692724ad26b1e668bc1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D140738E_BA9B_4F3D_8411_8E98B35C97B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t do it. ⟪k:1⟫All the strength I could muster wasn’t enough to make the man’s hand "
"budge. ⟪k:2⟫My arms were locked in place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non potevo riuscirci. ⟪k:1⟫Tutta la forza che ero in grado di tirare fuori⟪k:2⟫non bastava "
"per smuovere la mano dell’uomo. ⟪k:3⟫Le mie braccia erano bloccate sul posto."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B1709379_FCD0_44C9_8B31_332A230F7D21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3ea04ff2edad110dcd69e18ead40b45a4c0337270925cc991bda57a3b7b7330
#. default-sha256: 114e98f8fdaa0dc861065ca54e16a5f27c8b8e82b00822587efa3df75f5f6e94
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B1709379_FCD0_44C9_8B31_332A230F7D21"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t think he was especially strong, either. ⟪k:1⟫He was hardly built like Didier."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non era nemmeno tanto forte. ⟪k:1⟫Di certo non aveva il fisico di Didier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D07D61E7_BE90_4A13_A224_5D00CA7DE1D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dc4a15d5c52caadf58e13b680c9fd74adc6998a61ed66dc93e692fa9a31d6fa
#. default-sha256: 282124b27ce85d98f811481251aef4543d1d13fee8f23d6759050a2a5487cb3e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D07D61E7_BE90_4A13_A224_5D00CA7DE1D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And still, I couldn’t move an inch."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eppure, non riuscivo a muovermi di un millimetro."

#: scenario7:scenario7_47F28688_18BC_441F_A681_577F536C14C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89470747860ac99501d689acc917311acf9a9b068b4671fe7944a567ff45070c
#. default-sha256: 09f2393580953f6677c768d58b5b40432d7b7a8c91c8779d777eb4e1b931dfbb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_47F28688_18BC_441F_A681_577F536C14C6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Let go!⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Lasciami!⟪k:2⟫"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A3D34229_A936_4478_9E42_3FC21F5DFD03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d7afcf03ed0b369d0adb64d24619c0b3b91e067ccaf2327a91de5f4949214a1
#. default-sha256: 8c8513d8b92360cd1d9f1e8232d2c24e4ed9d3ad0461274164cd66bd567fd4e1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A3D34229_A936_4478_9E42_3FC21F5DFD03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had I always been this feeble?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Were my arms truly so worthless I couldn’t even "
"escape this brute’s grip?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ero stata sempre così fiacca?⟪k:1⟫ Le mie braccia erano davvero così inutili da non riuscire "
"nemmeno a sfuggire alla presa di un bruto come lui?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D68A60FE_62EC_46A4_B183_5542CF821C2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 700ab944d639de70ed61d268830817bc50fc2c3cefec06d9f3e5f151ed594690
#. default-sha256: 2212389f925fe52fa4c264df878cdb853343774197ef47c85107fc58dcb3aae9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D68A60FE_62EC_46A4_B183_5542CF821C2E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because I want a chance to try and woo you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I apologize if I made you uncomfortable "
"back there,⟪k:3⟫but the second I laid eyes on you, I knew you were a keeper."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perché voglio provare a corteggiarti.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perdonami se ti ho messa a disagio prima,⟪k:3⟫"
"ma nel momento in cui ho posato il mio sguardo su di te,⟪k:4⟫ho capito che eri una ragazza da non "
"farsi sfuggire."

#: scenario7:scenario7_401C7723_0908_4D2C_B09F_0FBDD57A1A3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4700b44d54861a67eb608001da47bdd6b14613d347638eceb4180e3038c4d9db
#. default-sha256: 1f334a6ca6c782f85da0267ca1dd2e0e03e51d3326fd649fbe99f1e302d1316b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_401C7723_0908_4D2C_B09F_0FBDD57A1A3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Then let go of me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Allora lasciami!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A074C8FB_C811_4EDE_9AAD_0D9975D001A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 427818296d7f8bf906f94180cbeacd404b68f1c4f4039c40bfff649f82f77c26
#. default-sha256: d68ce4fdff1c942bebe93058b6347f868ea31d549a153e8ede2fed15eb854163
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A074C8FB_C811_4EDE_9AAD_0D9975D001A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to vomit."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Volevo vomitare."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8665B515_625B_487D_B15B_7579834A3333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc9ca46ab83b053df6485753be6388f2e66972cfd9e110a475f6add6af105bf2
#. default-sha256: fc9517ad321609ce8d58045d337cb2c9c3e723c934052e389e4ff6463ed1960d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8665B515_625B_487D_B15B_7579834A3333"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently taking my silence for approval, the man perked up and kept going."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Prendendo il mio silenzio come approvazione, l’uomo si fomentò⟪k:1⟫e proseguì."

#: scenario7:scenario7_477BE831_2C3F_4DA7_A87D_ED9E91533BDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86a1c8fa9a3b569b1b70ea3149e2e0fe6ce07266a545c755fbb6772ac8601186
#. default-sha256: f521cc4e7f5b5d9496e4615e8827d383d6e5ba7228973df29fd113eb8eac62ca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_477BE831_2C3F_4DA7_A87D_ED9E91533BDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If you’re not accustomed to being around men,⟪k:1⟫then why not use this as an opportunity to "
"get familiar?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Not a half-bad idea, if I do say so myself.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And I think we’d get "
"along quite well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se non sei abituata a stare insieme agli uomini,⟪k:1⟫perché non usare quest’opportunità per "
"familiarizzare?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non è poi così male come idea, se devo dire la mia.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Sono "
"convinto che andremmo molto d’accordo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C7AB2E98_11A2_4AE4_A5DC_31D99787F41C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1399e92e87d40eddba8aced765810fa19d58a3282c0e8ef15b89a3352533780
#. default-sha256: 1d1b90a7c7bdf537904cf70311d3f39a3e957b9a1a6b92115da43fabdfb21763
