msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Was I just not interested in men?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, if that were the case, I wouldn’t admire my "
"brothers’ bodies."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Davvero non ero interessata agli uomini?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, se fosse stato quello il caso, non "
"avrei ammirato il fisico dei miei fratelli."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B7102D6_BADC_4D8C_89EA_63D52E63D766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3f1447c2084666f0b615399a9a93aaeaddc018b938af0300deeccd6150f1081
