msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6B7102D6_BADC_4D8C_89EA_63D52E63D766"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t have an aversion to men. ⟪k:1⟫In fact, I enjoyed spending time with my brothers far "
"more than indulging my mother and her woman’s world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non provavo un’avversione verso gli uomini. ⟪k:1⟫Anzi, mi divertivo più⟪k:2⟫a trascorrere il "
"tempo insieme a Georges e Didier piuttosto che ad assecondare mia madre e il suo mondo femminile."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C52ADAAF_0295_41D1_8CF7_2A62EC8B68F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c4b2f8e8aa34b8a5aad1b41255779db942f3b0624f129bef150b2f9a9b77371
