msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But ⟪k:1⟫why⟪k:2⟫? Why did I not like that?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had no answer. My thoughts were only "
"going in circles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma ⟪k:1⟫perché⟪k:2⟫? Perché non lo sopportavo?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non avevo alcuna risposta. I miei "
"pensieri giravano in tondo."

